theme_override_font_sizes/font_size = 10
text = "• GLOBAL:
[ESC]: Toggle in-game Pause Menu across all stages.

• STAGE 1: SPACECRAFT DESIGNER
- Mouse Left-Click: Select structural body, power source, engines, antenna, and science payloads.
- Right-Click + Drag: Orbit 3D spacecraft camera.
- Mouse Wheel: Zoom in and out.

• STAGE 2: MATHEMATICAL ENGINEERING LAB
- Mouse Left-Click: Select calculation field.
- Keypad / Keyboard: Input numeric answers.
- Calculator Button: Open integrated scientific expression evaluator.
- Mission AI Button: Query local aerospace assistant for contextual hints.

• STAGE 3: PAD 39A ROCKET LAUNCH
- Throttle Lever / [W]/[S]: Move throttle lever.
- Engine Ignition: Clamps release automatically above 90% throttle.
- [1], [2], [3]: Toggle Launch Tower, Under-Rocket Trench, and Ascent Tracking cameras.

• STAGE 4: INTERPLANETARY SPACEFLIGHT
- [W]/[S]: Adjust main bipropellant propulsion throttle.
- [A]/[D]: Yaw spacecraft attitude.
- [Q]/[E]: Roll spacecraft attitude.
- [C]: Cycle Cockpit, Exterior, Nav Transfer Map, and Mars Arrival cameras.
- Time Warp: [1x], [100x], [10,000x] simulation acceleration.

• STAGE 5: MARS POWERED DESCENT & ROVER DRIVING
- Descent Retro-Thrust: [W]/[S] keys or right-side thrust slider.
- Attitude Drift: [A]/[D] keys to counter lateral surface drift.
- Target Touchdown Speed: Under 1.5 m/s for nominal score.
- 6-Wheel Rover Driving: [W]/[S] drive forward/reverse, [A]/[D] steering, [Space] handbrake.
- [E]: Examine geological target and deploy robotic arm / sample cache."
